  "version": "0.5.0",
  "notes": "Add wifi_uplink.py: Wi-Fi STA uplink (multiple saved networks, tried in priority order from wifi_credentials.py) tried before cellular for internet access. Wired into ota.py (OTA checks) and sheets_log.py (Sheets logging), both falling back to cellular automatically if Wi-Fi isn't configured or fails to connect. Safe because both only run before BLE starts (main.py's boot flow) or as standalone bench tests -- Wi-Fi and BLE share one radio on the Pico W and cannot run at the same time. See OTA_UPDATE.md / APPS_SCRIPT_SETUP.md.",
